WEBVTT

00:05.580 --> 00:06.710
<b>Junta.</b>

00:07.380 --> 00:10.460
<b>If you're not busy now,
can you do some shopping for me?</b>

00:11.460 --> 00:12.420
<b>Sure.</b>

00:13.080 --> 00:14.040
<b>Big bwutha!</b>

00:15.130 --> 00:16.460
<b>I go too!</b>

00:16.920 --> 00:18.500
<b>Well, let's go together then.</b>

00:19.130 --> 00:19.670
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:20.460 --> 00:22.500
<b>Please wait</b>

00:22.960 --> 00:25.420
<b>Big bwutha, buy hot chocolate!</b>

00:25.830 --> 00:27.290
<b>I'm not buying you hot chocolate.</b>

00:28.880 --> 00:30.170
<b>Buy ice cweam?</b>

00:30.830 --> 00:32.290
<b>I'm not buying you ice cream either.</b>

00:36.960 --> 00:39.750
<b>Jikan yo tomare</b>

00:39.750 --> 00:43.790
<b>Sukoshi dake</b>

00:45.960 --> 00:49.380
<b>Hajimari wa itsu datta?</b>

00:49.380 --> 00:53.040
<b>Mou oboetenai kedo</b>

00:53.880 --> 00:57.630
<b>Sore mo ii ka tte sa</b>

00:57.630 --> 01:00.380
<b>Taai mo nai koto</b>

01:00.920 --> 01:04.000
<b>Itsudatte ki ga tsukeba</b>

01:04.000 --> 01:08.130
<b>Waratte naitari shite</b>

01:08.580 --> 01:14.080
<b>Tamani iji hattari mo shitari ne</b>

01:15.420 --> 01:25.330
<b>Shingou ga kawareba seeno de susumu ikisaki (konomama)</b>

01:25.330 --> 01:29.290
<b>Iwanakutemo (dokomademo)</b>

01:29.460 --> 01:32.420
<b>Ikeru yo ne kitto</b>

01:32.420 --> 01:36.080
<b>Dramatic janakutemo</b>

01:36.250 --> 01:39.920
<b>Taikutsu da to nagetemo</b>

01:40.210 --> 01:45.170
<b>Itsuka futo omoidasu</b>

01:45.630 --> 01:46.630
<b>Kyou o</b>

01:47.170 --> 01:50.880
<b>Romantic na kotoba mo</b>

01:51.040 --> 01:54.460
<b>Nakute ii yo dakara</b>

01:54.540 --> 01:57.210
<b>Jikan yo tomare</b>

01:57.210 --> 02:01.130
<b>Sukoshi dake</b>

02:01.630 --> 02:03.540
<b>Tsubuyaita</b>

02:07.330 --> 02:12.880
<b>Episode 8: Picnic and Miscommunication</b>

02:07.670 --> 02:09.880
<b>The cherry blossoms are already in bloom.</b>

02:09.880 --> 02:11.000
<b>Yep!</b>

02:11.920 --> 02:14.420
<b>Anyway, you sure are chipper, Saki.</b>

02:14.750 --> 02:15.290
<b>Yeah!</b>

02:15.750 --> 02:18.500
<b>Tomorrow's the cherry blossom
viewing picnic with Nagi-chan!</b>

02:18.790 --> 02:20.040
<b>I'm so excited!</b>

02:20.460 --> 02:22.290
<b>What should we do for lunch?</b>

02:22.880 --> 02:26.630
<b>Let's make lunch together since you can cook now too.</b>

02:27.040 --> 02:27.580
<b>Okay!</b>

02:28.290 --> 02:28.920
<b>Oh!</b>

02:29.670 --> 02:31.790
<b>Are you gonna help us cook too, Nagisa?</b>

02:33.420 --> 02:35.960
<b>No, I suck at cooking.</b>

02:37.250 --> 02:39.580
<b>I wanted to cook with Nagi-chan…</b>

02:41.210 --> 02:43.830
<b>She wants you to whip up some dark matter.</b>

02:43.830 --> 02:44.920
<b>Akina!</b>

02:48.540 --> 02:51.540
<b>But if you'll eat my cooking…</b>

02:52.420 --> 02:54.330
<b>That's enough for me.</b>

02:55.000 --> 02:56.580
<b>R-really?</b>

02:57.880 --> 03:01.170
<b>I'll do my best to make it as yummy as possible.</b>

03:02.880 --> 03:03.830
<b>Nagisa.</b>

03:05.500 --> 03:08.040
<b>Your big sis is gonna try her best too.</b>

03:11.250 --> 03:13.380
<b>Saki, let's go.</b>

03:13.380 --> 03:14.210
<b>Okay!</b>

03:14.210 --> 03:15.210
<b>No!</b>

03:15.210 --> 03:18.830
<b>You're so cruel to your sister! So cruel!</b>

03:20.170 --> 03:21.880
<b>Should we make sandwiches?</b>

03:21.880 --> 03:23.170
<b>Or onigiris?</b>

03:23.580 --> 03:25.460
<b>That's a tough one.</b>

03:25.460 --> 03:28.250
<b>Potato salad and fried chicken would be good too.</b>

03:28.460 --> 03:29.630
<b>Yeah, they would.</b>

03:30.500 --> 03:32.000
<b>I'm going over there for a sec.</b>

03:32.000 --> 03:32.630
<b>Huh?</b>

03:33.040 --> 03:34.170
<b>All right then.</b>

03:38.540 --> 03:40.670
<b>I'm going too.</b>

03:41.380 --> 03:41.880
<b>Huh?</b>

03:43.380 --> 03:45.210
<b>What's so great over there?</b>

03:45.500 --> 03:46.170
<b>Oh?</b>

03:46.170 --> 03:48.170
<b>Potatoes</b>

03:46.170 --> 03:48.170
<b>All-you-can-fit sale</b>

03:48.460 --> 03:49.790
<b>Oh!</b>

03:50.210 --> 03:52.210
<b>Potatoes</b>

03:50.210 --> 03:52.210
<b>All-you-can-fit sale</b>

03:50.210 --> 03:52.210
<b>Shop now!</b>

03:52.290 --> 03:54.000
<b>I got a bunch of potatoes into the sale basket.</b>

03:54.380 --> 03:56.210
<b>Big bwutha's awesome!</b>

03:56.210 --> 03:57.210
<b>Thanks.</b>

03:58.790 --> 04:00.460
<b>Oh, hewwo!</b>

04:01.670 --> 04:02.330
<b>Seita?</b>

04:04.920 --> 04:06.880
<b>Hi there, Seita-kun.</b>

04:07.170 --> 04:09.210
<b>You said hello like a big boy!</b>

04:09.210 --> 04:10.880
<b>K..Kubo-san?</b>

04:11.250 --> 04:14.250
<b>Look, look! Big bwutha's awesome!</b>

04:14.580 --> 04:17.210
<b>Wow! That's a ton of potatoes!</b>

04:17.460 --> 04:22.710
<b>New</b>

04:17.460 --> 04:22.710
<b>products</b>

04:23.460 --> 04:25.710
<b>You're awesome, big brother.</b>

04:28.130 --> 04:28.830
<b>Um…</b>

04:30.000 --> 04:32.000
<b>That's really awesome.</b>

04:32.000 --> 04:33.170
<b>Woah! Saki!</b>

04:35.040 --> 04:36.880
<b>H-hello.</b>

04:37.500 --> 04:40.130
<b>Shop now!</b>

04:38.670 --> 04:39.670
<b>Hello.</b>

04:41.380 --> 04:43.130
<b>Oh, err, that's right.</b>

04:43.130 --> 04:45.830
<b>Seita, say hello to Saki-chan.</b>

04:57.080 --> 04:58.500
<b>Seita, what's wrong?</b>

04:58.790 --> 05:01.040
<b>You said hello to Kubo-san just fine.</b>

05:04.130 --> 05:05.830
<b>Is this your little brother?</b>

05:05.830 --> 05:08.750
<b>Oh, yeah. His name is Seita.</b>

05:09.080 --> 05:10.130
<b>Seita-kun.</b>

05:13.330 --> 05:14.330
<b>Hello.</b>

05:23.210 --> 05:24.040
<b>A rock.</b>

05:26.040 --> 05:26.880
<b>That's...</b>

05:27.830 --> 05:30.670
<b>Seita's favorite pretty rock.</b>

05:33.290 --> 05:34.750
<b>Are you giving it to me?</b>

05:38.210 --> 05:39.670
<b>Thank you.</b>

05:44.080 --> 05:47.960
<b>What are you guys looking at? Shiraishi-san, Nagi-chan?</b>

05:50.380 --> 05:56.080
<b>Oh my! Saki playing big sister
and Nagisa saying "big brother"</b>

05:56.500 --> 05:58.580
<b>are so pure.</b>

06:00.830 --> 06:02.250
<b>At any rate…</b>

06:06.920 --> 06:09.750
<b>You're an expert at stuffing those baskets, kiddo!</b>

06:09.750 --> 06:12.170
<b>That'd be a huge help if you could fill our basket too.</b>

06:12.290 --> 06:13.670
<b>Sure.</b>

06:13.670 --> 06:14.920
<b>Thanks!</b>

06:15.380 --> 06:19.460
<b>By the way, do you and Seita-kun
have any plans tomorrow?</b>

06:19.880 --> 06:20.830
<b>Not really.</b>

06:21.670 --> 06:24.080
<b>Well, do you wanna come to our picnic?</b>

06:24.290 --> 06:27.380
<b>We'll treat you to lunch as a thanks for the potatoes.</b>

06:27.500 --> 06:28.130
<b>Uh…</b>

06:28.960 --> 06:29.960
<b>Akina-san!</b>

06:31.000 --> 06:35.540
<b>Hey, Seita-kun, you'd love to play with Saki, right?</b>

06:36.920 --> 06:39.250
<b>I wanna pway.</b>

06:42.880 --> 06:45.040
<b>So? What did you say, Saki?</b>

06:46.330 --> 06:48.330
<b>Nothing.</b>

06:49.380 --> 06:50.880
<b>Nagisa, that's okay with you too, right?</b>

06:52.170 --> 06:53.080
<b>Right?</b>

06:53.960 --> 06:56.380
<b>Going together as a group would be fun,</b>

06:58.420 --> 06:59.540
<b>so why not?</b>

07:00.040 --> 07:01.170
<b>There you go!</b>

07:02.130 --> 07:03.790
<b>You're coming, right, kiddo?</b>

07:04.420 --> 07:07.750
<b>Yeah. See you guys tomorrow.</b>

07:07.750 --> 07:09.080
<b>Yay!</b>

07:09.750 --> 07:12.210
<b>So I'm inquiring once more…</b>

07:14.080 --> 07:16.130
<b>Are you cooking lunch with us?</b>

07:21.960 --> 07:23.420
<b>Hmm…</b>

07:34.210 --> 07:35.380
<b>I'm here!</b>

07:35.960 --> 07:37.460
<b>Oh, come on in!</b>

07:37.960 --> 07:40.460
<b>Did you already start making lunch?</b>

07:40.790 --> 07:43.750
<b>Ah. Nagisa started without us.</b>

07:44.000 --> 07:45.250
<b>By herself?</b>

07:45.880 --> 07:48.210
<b>You gotta see her, Saki.</b>

07:48.210 --> 07:51.080
<b>I laughed so much it made my stomach hurt.</b>

07:55.790 --> 07:58.790
<b>The onion is gone.</b>

08:00.290 --> 08:04.170
<b>Nagisa's been peeling that onion this whole time.</b>

08:04.540 --> 08:05.630
<b>Nagi-chan…</b>

08:07.250 --> 08:10.040
<b>What's she trying to cook, by the way?</b>

08:10.460 --> 08:14.790
<b>She wants to make hamburger steak
and bring it for our lunch.</b>

08:15.080 --> 08:16.500
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

08:21.710 --> 08:23.330
<b>You're really gung ho!</b>

08:23.630 --> 08:28.000
<b>That's because I'm better at cooking
than Nagi-chan and can help her.</b>

08:32.670 --> 08:34.710
<b>Why are you hugging me?</b>

08:34.960 --> 08:37.330
<b>Well, you're so cute I couldn't help it.</b>

08:38.920 --> 08:42.380
<b>Will you help Nagisa?</b>

08:42.750 --> 08:47.540
<b>It's her first time making it, and if she makes it
by herself, no doubt she'll make a mistake.</b>

08:48.040 --> 08:49.080
<b>Okay!</b>

08:52.080 --> 08:56.170
<b>All right. I'll get started soon too.</b>

08:56.500 --> 08:58.290
<b>Ah, good morning, Saki.</b>

08:58.290 --> 08:59.710
<b>Good morning.</b>

09:00.580 --> 09:04.830
<b>Nagi-chan, Nagi-chan! You don't need
to peel onions that far back.</b>

09:06.960 --> 09:08.130
<b>This much is fine.</b>

09:08.130 --> 09:09.710
<b>What, really?</b>

09:10.960 --> 09:11.750
<b>Um…</b>

09:13.630 --> 09:16.210
<b>Can I help you…</b>

09:17.580 --> 09:19.170
<b>make hamburger steak?</b>

09:21.500 --> 09:23.080
<b>Thank you, Saki.</b>

09:25.250 --> 09:29.920
<b>Um, well, first finely chop the onion.</b>

09:30.330 --> 09:33.500
<b>Nagi-chan, you can mince it, and…</b>

09:34.330 --> 09:35.420
<b>Leave it to me!</b>

09:39.460 --> 09:40.630
<b>Nagi-chan.</b>

09:40.790 --> 09:42.380
<b>Make cat paws.</b>

09:42.380 --> 09:43.960
<b>Oh, gotcha.</b>

09:44.250 --> 09:46.330
<b>Also, to finely chop an onion,</b>

09:46.630 --> 09:51.380
<b>first cut the onion in half,
then make slices through the onion. After that…</b>

09:52.790 --> 09:54.710
<b>Do you want me to do that?</b>

09:55.080 --> 09:56.630
<b>No, I've got it.</b>

09:57.330 --> 09:58.380
<b>Nagi-chan!</b>

09:58.380 --> 09:59.580
<b>Wah! What's going on over there?</b>

10:02.500 --> 10:03.580
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

10:04.250 --> 10:06.330
<b>This isn't your fault.</b>

10:06.710 --> 10:08.330
<b>I just nicked myself anyway.</b>

10:08.710 --> 10:11.630
<b>All right! Let's get back to making hamburger steak.</b>

10:15.250 --> 10:17.670
<b>I'll make the hamburger steak.</b>

10:17.790 --> 10:18.330
<b>Huh?</b>

10:19.080 --> 10:22.380
<b>Wait, I wanna cook hamburger steak.</b>

10:22.920 --> 10:26.380
<b>I'm afraid you'll hurt yourself again.</b>

10:28.460 --> 10:30.210
<b>Please don't worry.</b>

10:30.210 --> 10:32.420
<b>I'll make sure it's delicious.</b>

10:35.000 --> 10:36.040
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

10:43.250 --> 10:45.540
<b>Is Nagisa not helping with the hamburger steak?</b>

10:45.960 --> 10:48.040
<b>She's taking a break right now.</b>

10:48.330 --> 10:50.290
<b>I'm cooking it instead.</b>

10:50.710 --> 10:51.920
<b>What?</b>

10:51.920 --> 10:53.380
<b>Did she throw in the towel?</b>

10:55.330 --> 10:56.080
<b>No.</b>

10:56.830 --> 10:59.580
<b>She still wanted to make it.</b>

11:00.750 --> 11:03.500
<b>But I said I'd make it myself.</b>

11:04.130 --> 11:09.130
<b>I was trying to help,
but I accidently caused her to hurt herself.</b>

11:10.170 --> 11:12.380
<b>She hurt herself due to her own carelessness, right?</b>

11:12.380 --> 11:14.170
<b>It's not your fault.</b>

11:15.000 --> 11:16.000
<b>But…</b>

11:19.250 --> 11:21.250
<b>How should I put it?</b>

11:21.880 --> 11:26.750
<b>I think it's important for people
to learn from their mistakes.</b>

11:28.250 --> 11:30.750
<b>Instead of quitting because you failed,</b>

11:30.750 --> 11:34.130
<b>see it as a chance to think about what
you can do to not repeat your mistake.</b>

11:35.250 --> 11:38.130
<b>Mistakes aren't pointless. They're experience.</b>

11:38.380 --> 11:40.500
<b>And experience is priceless.</b>

11:41.630 --> 11:46.250
<b>Nagisa isn't the type of person
who repeats the same mistakes.</b>

11:46.710 --> 11:49.250
<b>As her older sister, I can promise you that.</b>

11:50.380 --> 11:53.630
<b>Can you give her one more chance?</b>

11:56.290 --> 11:56.920
<b>Saki.</b>

11:57.500 --> 11:58.580
<b>Nagi-chan…</b>

12:01.080 --> 12:06.540
<b>I want to cook the hamburger steak
myself, despite everything.</b>

12:08.500 --> 12:11.500
<b>This time I'll be super careful not to cut my finger.</b>

12:08.580 --> 12:16.710
<b>Flailing</b>

12:11.500 --> 12:15.540
<b>Er, I might make other mistakes though.</b>

12:18.290 --> 12:19.330
<b>So can I help?</b>

12:22.710 --> 12:24.130
<b>What's with you two?</b>

12:26.130 --> 12:32.170
<b>I started cooking to help Nagi-chan,
but I gave up after one mistake.</b>

12:33.920 --> 12:37.460
<b>I was thinking I'm the hopeless one.</b>

12:40.210 --> 12:43.880
<b>Nagi-chan, let's make some
delicious hamburger steak together.</b>

12:44.330 --> 12:45.920
<b>I'll do the best I can too.</b>

12:47.790 --> 12:48.540
<b>Okay!</b>

13:08.960 --> 13:09.960
<b>Done!</b>

13:10.290 --> 13:13.170
<b>It's all thanks to you, Saki. Thank you.</b>

13:13.170 --> 13:14.080
<b>That's not true.</b>

13:14.750 --> 13:18.250
<b>So, why'd you wanna make hamburger steak so badly?</b>

13:19.790 --> 13:20.960
<b>Nagi-chan?</b>

13:21.960 --> 13:23.210
<b>Don't tell me it's because…</b>

13:24.460 --> 13:26.750
<b>I was just in the mood for some today.</b>

13:29.290 --> 13:33.130
<b>This is the first time she's made hamburger steak, right?</b>

13:33.790 --> 13:34.830
<b>Yep, that's right.</b>

13:35.920 --> 13:39.380
<b>Nagi-chan, Nagi-chan, give me a bite.</b>

13:39.790 --> 13:41.460
<b>We need to taste it.</b>

13:41.920 --> 13:43.460
<b>Oh, right.</b>

13:50.130 --> 13:51.380
<b>I get it.</b>

13:52.250 --> 13:55.080
<b>She's not giving away the first taste to someone else.</b>

14:06.460 --> 14:07.960
<b>Woah!</b>

14:08.330 --> 14:10.540
<b>So many fwowers!</b>

14:10.830 --> 14:15.080
<b>Ah, the cherry blossoms are in full bloom!
This is wonderful!</b>

14:16.380 --> 14:18.130
<b>Where was our spot?</b>

14:19.290 --> 14:21.040
<b>There are food stalls too.</b>

14:27.750 --> 14:29.750
<b>Aren't the cherry blossoms beautiful?</b>

14:30.630 --> 14:32.000
<b>Yeah, they… Sure are.</b>

14:34.920 --> 14:37.540
<b>Sorry about that, I didn't eat breakfast.</b>

14:38.920 --> 14:40.130
<b>Shiraishi-kun,</b>

14:40.630 --> 14:43.670
<b>were you that excited to eat the lunch we made?</b>

14:46.380 --> 14:47.580
<b>Um…</b>

14:48.500 --> 14:51.540
<b>C'mon, hurry up you two!</b>

14:52.210 --> 14:53.250
<b>Okay!</b>

14:54.170 --> 14:56.000
<b>Let's go, Shiraishi-kun.</b>

14:57.380 --> 14:58.210
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:02.040 --> 15:03.790
<b>It looks dewicious!</b>

15:04.130 --> 15:05.420
<b>Wow.</b>

15:05.420 --> 15:07.460
<b>It looks too good to eat.</b>

15:07.960 --> 15:10.580
<b>Oh, no, it's not all that.</b>

15:11.080 --> 15:12.880
<b>All right, everyone.</b>

15:13.540 --> 15:15.250
<b>Let's eat!</b>

15:16.170 --> 15:17.500
<b>Here, Seita-kun.</b>

15:17.500 --> 15:18.630
<b>Say "aah."</b>

15:23.710 --> 15:25.130
<b>What a great expression!</b>

15:25.670 --> 15:28.040
<b>Saki made that.</b>

15:28.040 --> 15:29.330
<b>Saki-cha!</b>

15:31.380 --> 15:32.750
<b>Yummy!</b>

15:34.710 --> 15:37.250
<b>Saki also made the potato salad.</b>

15:37.830 --> 15:39.710
<b>Do you want some, Seita?</b>

15:39.830 --> 15:40.670
<b>Yeah!</b>

15:41.290 --> 15:42.170
<b>Here you go.</b>

15:45.290 --> 15:46.920
<b>Saki-chan, thank you.</b>

15:47.210 --> 15:48.420
<b>Tank you!</b>

15:48.830 --> 15:49.750
<b>Don't mention it.</b>

15:58.920 --> 16:01.080
<b>Ah, this is fantastic!</b>

16:01.080 --> 16:02.880
<b>It's great with alcohol!</b>

16:03.210 --> 16:05.380
<b>C'mon, kiddo, you eat up too!</b>

16:05.380 --> 16:06.750
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

16:07.080 --> 16:10.170
<b>Seriously Akina, go easy on the alcohol, all right?</b>

16:10.170 --> 16:12.460
<b>I know, I know!</b>

16:12.460 --> 16:13.830
<b>For real?</b>

16:14.080 --> 16:15.170
<b>Yeah, yeah.</b>

16:14.420 --> 16:15.790
<b>There's hamburger steak.</b>

16:16.920 --> 16:18.830
<b>But it's a little far away from me.</b>

16:19.420 --> 16:21.830
<b>I'll eat something else to start with.</b>

16:21.830 --> 16:22.580
<b>Here.</b>

16:23.210 --> 16:24.040
<b>Huh?</b>

16:26.880 --> 16:28.290
<b>You wanted to eat some, right?</b>

16:29.000 --> 16:30.500
<b>How'd you know that?</b>

16:30.960 --> 16:33.250
<b>You were staring at the hamburger steak.</b>

16:33.630 --> 16:35.080
<b>Th-thank you.</b>

16:35.750 --> 16:37.080
<b>No problem.</b>

16:38.000 --> 16:39.130
<b>Down the hatch.</b>

16:46.170 --> 16:47.130
<b>It's delicious!</b>

16:47.130 --> 16:47.790
<b>Ah!</b>

17:02.920 --> 17:06.170
<b>They're both such lovebirds!</b>

17:07.250 --> 17:08.380
<b>Big sis?</b>

17:08.380 --> 17:10.670
<b>Akina, you've had a little too much to drink.</b>

17:10.670 --> 17:14.040
<b>Alcohol</b>

17:11.250 --> 17:14.920
<b>Know what, I've thought this for a while.</b>

17:16.460 --> 17:19.830
<b>I'm not your big sis yet, kiddo!</b>

17:21.540 --> 17:29.580
<b>Sure, Nagisa kinda acted like a wife earlier.</b>

17:30.290 --> 17:35.040
<b>But I ain't your big sister yet, kiddo.</b>

17:35.040 --> 17:37.330
<b>Akina, what the heck are you talking about?</b>

17:37.710 --> 17:39.330
<b>She's right, Akina-san.</b>

17:39.830 --> 17:41.750
<b>So…</b>

17:42.830 --> 17:45.250
<b>Call me Akina-san,</b>

17:45.630 --> 17:48.080
<b>and I'll call you Junta-kun back.</b>

17:48.420 --> 17:50.830
<b>You're drunk, right?</b>

17:51.000 --> 17:53.000
<b>You can't call me by my name?</b>

17:53.000 --> 17:57.670
<b>If you won't say my name, well, I…</b>

17:58.170 --> 17:59.170
<b>Nagi-cha…</b>

17:59.710 --> 18:02.000
<b>I wanna eat yakitori from a food stall!</b>

18:03.210 --> 18:04.210
<b>Akina!</b>

18:06.380 --> 18:09.460
<b>I really hate that kind of harassment.</b>

18:11.040 --> 18:12.580
<b>Sorry, Shiraishi-kun.</b>

18:12.580 --> 18:14.210
<b>Oh, er…</b>

18:14.210 --> 18:16.000
<b>Saki, watch my sister.</b>

18:16.000 --> 18:16.670
<b>Huh?</b>

18:17.250 --> 18:18.790
<b>I'm gonna go buy some yakitori.</b>

18:20.290 --> 18:22.000
<b>Ah, I'll go buy it!</b>

18:25.330 --> 18:27.540
<b>My legs fell asleep.</b>

18:27.920 --> 18:29.000
<b>Big bwutha.</b>

18:29.130 --> 18:32.040
<b>Shiraishi-san, how pathetic of you.</b>

18:37.330 --> 18:39.880
<b>Kubo-san is upset, isn't she?</b>

18:40.420 --> 18:41.250
<b>Her…</b>

18:42.540 --> 18:48.380
<b>Angry expression, or maybe it was
her angry aura, was stupid scary.</b>

18:49.580 --> 18:51.540
<b>Big bwutha, you fighting?</b>

18:51.540 --> 18:54.250
<b>It's not exactly a fight, I think.</b>

18:56.580 --> 18:58.250
<b>Big bwutha's fault?</b>

18:58.960 --> 19:01.080
<b>I dunno. Maybe.</b>

19:01.500 --> 19:03.880
<b>Big bwutha! Make up!</b>

19:03.880 --> 19:05.750
<b>It's not as simple as that.</b>

19:06.210 --> 19:08.790
<b>Gotta make up!</b>

19:08.790 --> 19:10.540
<b>Okay, okay! I will.</b>

19:12.040 --> 19:13.170
<b>I'll try my best to.</b>

19:15.830 --> 19:18.210
<b>Although I said I would make up with her…</b>

19:19.500 --> 19:21.130
<b>How should I do that?</b>

19:23.960 --> 19:25.750
<b>K..Kubo-san.</b>

19:27.580 --> 19:29.000
<b>S-sorry.</b>

19:32.500 --> 19:35.170
<b>It wasn't even your fault.</b>

19:36.540 --> 19:37.330
<b>Oh!</b>

19:47.540 --> 19:49.830
<b>The way I was acting earlier wasn't great.</b>

19:50.210 --> 19:52.170
<b>Plus, it was my sister's fault.</b>

19:55.000 --> 19:56.630
<b>Oh, Seita-kun?</b>

19:56.960 --> 19:58.250
<b>Where's Shiraishi-kun?</b>

20:01.080 --> 20:02.790
<b>Shiraishi-kun!</b>

20:03.750 --> 20:05.040
<b>Make up.</b>

20:06.250 --> 20:07.380
<b>Nagi-cha.</b>

20:10.250 --> 20:11.330
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

20:20.420 --> 20:21.670
<b>Shiraishi-kun.</b>

20:22.750 --> 20:25.210
<b>I'm really sorry about how I was acting earlier.</b>

20:27.540 --> 20:28.880
<b>I'm sorry too.</b>

20:29.750 --> 20:32.380
<b>It honestly wasn't your fault.</b>

20:34.000 --> 20:38.920
<b>I puzzled over it a lot, but I still don't get why you're mad.</b>

20:39.420 --> 20:45.380
<b>You said it's not my fault,
but it seemed like you were just being nice.</b>

20:46.710 --> 20:50.080
<b>I'm sorry I'm dense about so many things.</b>

20:51.040 --> 20:54.790
<b>You thought about me that much?</b>

20:58.210 --> 20:59.080
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:00.170 --> 21:01.080
<b>Gotcha.</b>

21:02.830 --> 21:05.000
<b>Well, let's go buy some yakitori.</b>

21:05.420 --> 21:08.130
<b>If we're not quick, I'll feel sorry for Saki.</b>

21:08.130 --> 21:09.920
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

21:11.330 --> 21:12.960
<b>Made up?</b>

21:12.960 --> 21:14.960
<b>Yep, we made up.</b>

21:15.210 --> 21:16.250
<b>Howd hands!</b>

21:16.880 --> 21:17.630
<b>Howd?</b>

21:18.670 --> 21:23.250
<b>Seita, err, we don't need to hold hands today.</b>

21:24.000 --> 21:27.290
<b>I dunno. I wanna hold hands.</b>

21:27.750 --> 21:28.420
<b>Huh?</b>

21:31.000 --> 21:33.790
<b>Oh, this is what she meant.</b>

21:34.330 --> 21:38.040
<b>Oh, just forget about what my sister
said when she was drunk.</b>

21:38.040 --> 21:39.630
<b>A-all right.</b>

21:40.920 --> 21:43.710
<b>By the way, the new school year is starting soon.</b>

21:44.080 --> 21:46.290
<b>I wonder if we'll be in the same class.</b>

21:46.790 --> 21:47.920
<b>No idea.</b>

21:48.960 --> 21:50.380
<b>Shiraishi-kun,</b>

21:50.790 --> 21:53.040
<b>do you want to be in the same class as me?</b>

21:54.920 --> 21:56.040
<b>Same cwass?</b>

21:56.380 --> 21:59.460
<b>Yeah. I asked your big brother
if he'd like us to be in the same class together.</b>

21:59.880 --> 22:03.960
<b>Big bwutha, with Nagi-chan's gweat!</b>

22:05.420 --> 22:06.420
<b>Right?</b>

22:06.830 --> 22:07.920
<b>Right?</b>

22:12.170 --> 22:15.540
<b>Akanesasu kousha no kage</b>

22:15.540 --> 22:21.830
<b>Mitsukaranai hazu no seishun no hashikko ni</b>

22:22.080 --> 22:27.250
<b>Sukoshi suwareta kamo, kedo sugu kiechau kamo</b>

22:27.250 --> 22:31.500
<b>Kimi ga waraikakete kureru koto mo</b>

22:31.500 --> 22:33.420
<b>Kirei da ne</b>

22:33.420 --> 22:36.250
<b>Kiseki tte yonde ii kana</b>

22:36.500 --> 22:42.170
<b>Konna hibi ga suki da yo, suki da yo, sukida yo</b>

22:42.170 --> 22:48.630
<b>Datte zutto tsuzuku wake janai kara, dakishimeru no</b>

22:48.630 --> 22:52.750
<b>Kodomo kara chotto fumidashita haru no hi ni</b>

22:52.750 --> 22:56.130
<b>Susume, susume, susume, ippo zutsu</b>

22:56.130 --> 22:59.460
<b>Ima kasuka de tashikana kaze ga fuku</b>

22:59.460 --> 23:07.130
<b>Semete boku to kimi no aida wa sekai ga sukoshi irozukimasu youni</b>

23:07.130 --> 23:11.750
<b>Donna canvas o egaku kana, donna mirai ni naru kana</b>

23:11.750 --> 23:15.540
<b>Wakaranai kedo shinjite mitaina</b>

23:14.830 --> 23:19.130
<b>Egao de te o futtara kitto</b>

23:15.920 --> 23:18.960
<b>Jaa mata ne to ie tara</b>

23:18.960 --> 23:22.670
<b>Ashita ga sukoshi tanoshimi ni naru ne</b>

23:22.750 --> 23:29.630
<b>Kisetsu no hayasa ni sotte, kotoba kasaneru bokura</b>

23:29.630 --> 23:36.040
<b>Douka douka shiawase de arimasu youni da ne</b>
